.TH PHOTOCRAFT 1 "November 2026" "PhotoCraft 0.20.1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
photocraft \- open-source image editor with layers, masks and brushes
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B photocraft
.RI [ file ...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B photocraft
starts PhotoCraft, a native image editor written in Rust. It opens and saves layered PSD and PSB files, and works
with layers, masks, adjustment layers, layer styles, type and brushes. Files given on the command line are opened
as tabs, in the running window when PhotoCraft is already running.
.PP
PhotoCraft is in early alpha.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/photocraft/
Settings and logs (\fIlogs/photocraft.log\fR).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR photocraft-cli (1)
.PP
https://getartcraft.com/apps/photocraft
